# Claude Code: ignore personal/local config under .claude/, but keep
# the repo-wide subagent definitions in .claude/agents/ tracked so
# every contributor gets the same QA tooling (e.g. the verifier).
.claude/*
!.claude/agents/
!.claude/agents/**

# Validation per-cell archive — too big to commit (~700 KB/day gzipped,
# ~250 MB/year) and only used by the inline scoring step on the same CI
# disk. observations.jsonl, residuals.jsonl, and per_zone_metrics.json
# ARE committed (small, durable signal).
pipeline/validation/data/archive/

